currency CHF 0.01

account assets:cash
account liabilities:kids
  + assert virtual-only
account income:gifts

2025-01-27
  | A plain assertion on a virtual-only account can never carry information
  * assets:cash      +100.00 CHF
  * income:gifts     -100.00 CHF
  ! liabilities:kids  -50.00 CHF
  + assert liabilities:kids = +0.00 CHF
